{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0054_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ece4ff8a2dc95d9a573e529c6a0598f99fde2010581c7380d9e1498e112643e9", "ja": "えっ……は、はい……", "zh": "咦……好、好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0054_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e48d85f395afbcaeb169f42688ed1f76d2233df0e07c8d504229541300695714", "ja": "ごめんな。なるべく早くそっちに合流するから。\nそれじゃ、また後で！", "zh": "抱歉，我会尽快去排练现场找你的。\n那就待会见吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
