{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0054_1013_p", "source_sha256": "54fd2f7ea5423e13fc1834d1e967f7f09f585f323b491a41a82507fdc45d7b6c", "ja": "ん？　あ、これは俺のマフラー……？\nあ、そういえば、紬に貸しっぱなしだったな。", "zh": "嗯？啊，这是我的围巾……？\n我想起来了，之前借给䌷后就一直放在你那边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0054_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6ed475b0914f5b1716776553dca7ecb9fc333155cf8297b6d3e8f26f63af3fab", "ja": "……お返しします。貴方のものを借りたままでは、\n何を頼まれるかわかったものではありませんし。", "zh": "……这个还给你。要是一直欠着，\n谁知道你会对我做出什么要求。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0054_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "bb5febcd7f828172c1b7a3d0a58cabe03b492ac4959afc0cb0cd76d0524100d4", "ja": "それに、外は……とても寒いですから。\nどうか、お気をつけて。", "zh": "而且，外头……非常冷。\n请注意保暖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0054_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b1ea51aee50bed1d0062e4138372c63291e9b50ff7a389bff03ffa492055a543", "ja": "ああ、わざわざありがとう……って、すごいな！\nなんか前よりフワフワになってないか？", "zh": "这样啊，谢谢你专程带来还我……咦？好厉害！\n好像比借你之前更蓬松耶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0054_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "106bf100137d34161a20321c78ee5b13421ea3b7e4ed6fe0955d3aa94de548a5", "ja": "貴方の日頃の管理が良くないのです。きちんと洗えば\nこの通り……毛織物は丁寧に扱ってあげてください。", "zh": "那是因为你平时不懂得保养。只要用心清洗，\n就能整理成这样……请你细心善待毛织品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0054_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a42a2385905184069e569ae57b61afbd226d12e6bcc38dd7747608298d245306", "ja": "いいお品のようですし、今後も大切にしてくださいね。\n……くれぐれも。……くれぐれもです。", "zh": "这条围巾品质似乎不错，你以后要继续珍惜。\n……千万要爱惜……请千万要爱惜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0054_1019_p", "source_sha256": "b6b6cba4eda89d420a0e0ea4de44fad6af0dea949c4a5fecd0b880045863967f", "ja": "あ、ああ。\nわかった、大事にする……よ？", "zh": "好、好的。\n我知道了，我会珍惜的……放心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
